      "content": "\n\n**解：**\n\n1. **确定节点与函数值**：\n   设给定的四个点为 $(x_0, y_0)=(0,1)$，$(x_1, y_1)=(1,3)$，$(x_2, y_2)=(2,7)$，$(x_3, y_3)=(3,13)$。\n\n2. **应用拉格朗日插值公式**：\n   所求多项式 $P(x)$ 可表示为：\n   $$P(x) = \\sum_{i=0}^{3} y_i L_i(x) = y_0 L_0(x) + y_1 L_1(x) + y_2 L_2(x) + y_3 L_3(x)$$\n   其中基函数 $L_i(x) = \\prod_{j \\neq i} \\frac{x - x_j}{x_i - x_j}$。\n\n3. **构造具体的基函数**：\n   分别计算各基函数的表达式：\n   - $L_0(x) = \\frac{(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)}{(0-1)(0-2)(0-3)} = \\frac{(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)}{-6}$\n   - $L_1(x) = \\frac{(x-0)(x-2)(x-3)}{(1-0)(1-2)(1-3)} = \\frac{x(x-2)(x-3)}{2}$\n   - $L_2(x) = \\frac{(x-0)(x-1)(x-3)}{(2-0)(2-1)(2-3)} = \\frac{x(x-1)(x-3)}{-2}$\n   - $L_3(x) = \\frac{(x-0)(x-1)(x-2)}{(3-0)(3-1)(3-2)} = \\frac{x(x-1)(x-2)}{6}$\n\n4. **组合与化简**：\n   将 $y_i$ 值代入求和公式：\n   $$P(x) = 1 \\cdot \\frac{(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)}{-6} + 3 \\cdot \\frac{x(x-2)(x-3)}{2} + 7 \\cdot \\frac{x(x-1)(x-3)}{-2} + 13 \\cdot \\frac{x(x-1)(x-2)}{6}$$\n   \n   通分，分母取 6：\n   $$P(x) = \\frac{-(x-1)(x-2)(x-3) + 9x(x-2)(x-3) - 21x(x-1)(x-3) + 13x(x-1)(x-2)}{6}$$\n   \n   展开分子各项：\n   - $-(x-1)(x-2)(x-3) = -(x^3 - 6x^2 + 11x - 6) = -x^3 + 6x^2 - 11x + 6$\n   - $9x(x-2)(x-3) = 9(x^3 - 5x^2 + 6x) = 9x^3 - 45x^2 + 54x$\n   - $-21x(x-1)(x-3) = -21(x^3 - 4x^2 + 3x) = -21x^3 + 84x^2 - 63x$\n   - $13x(x-1)(x-2) = 13(x^3 - 3x^2 + 2x) = 13x^3 - 39x^2 + 26x$\n   \n   合并同类项：\n   - $x^3$ 系数：$-1 + 9 - 21 + 13 = 0$\n   - $x^2$ 系数：$6 - 45 + 84 - 39 = 6$\n   - $x$ 系数：$-11 + 54 - 63 + 26 = 6$\n   - 常数项：$6$\n   \n   分子化简为 $6x^2 + 6x + 6$，故：\n   $$P(x) = \\frac{6x^2 + 6x + 6}{6} = x^2 + x + 1$$\n\n**最终答案：**\n所求多项式为 $P(x) = x^2 + x + 1$。"
